  "description": "Let’s shout it out again today: Safety First!\n\nAn era where Awakened Ones and Hunters thrive. Ha-Jun, a day laborer at a construction site, awakens as a “Labor Management Director.” But... the workers he summons are clearing dungeons all on their own?! Recruiting everyone from orcs to top-tier workers, Ha-Jun builds his own “auto-hunting” team. While Ha-Jun continues to expand his operations while hiding his true identity, his presence gradually begins to attract the attention of the nation’s top hunters and powerful foreign powers...!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
